  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of a set of green job indicators in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to develop a set of green job indicators in Vietnam to calculate and help better understand the impact of &quot;greening the economy&quot; on the labour market such as: quantity, analysis and forecast of trends over time of green jobs, green job allocation by industry, occupation, geographical location, and salary level of workers and ensure the development of effective solutions and policies to cope with the shift to a greener economy and promote sustainable growth.</narrative>
  </description>
